{"text": "Suncoast Aquatics Nature\n\nCenter Associates, Inc.\n\nMemo\n\nTo:\n\nFrom:\n\nDate:\n\nBoard of Directors.\n\nPaul Blackketter\n\nJanuary 11, 2016\n\nRecommended Motions for Finish Tower Agreement\n\nRecommended Motions:\n\n1.\n\nConceptual Desian Approval (Motion: | move to approve the conceptual design of the\nFinish Line Tower and authorize the President to approve plans and other documents\nsubstantially consistent with the conceptual design.)\nProject Construction Schedule: (Motion: | move to approve the Project Construction\n\u2018Schedule.)\nPledge Agreement (Motion: | move to approve the Pledge Agreement between Nathan\nBenderson Community Park Foundation, inc. and SANCA as recommended by staff,\nauthorizing the President to execute the Pledge Agreement and to make non-substantive\nchanges, if necessary.)\nConstruction Contract (Motion: | move to approve the Construction Contract,\ncomprising of AIA A101-2007 including Exhibit A and A201-2007 between Benderson\nDevelopment Company and SANCA as recommended by staff, and authorizing the\nPresident to execute the Construction Contract as recommended by staff and\n\u2018authorizing the President to make non-substantive changes if necessary.)\nDonation Agreement (Motion: | move to approve the Donation Agreement between\nBenderson Development Company and SANCA as recommended by staff, and\nauthorizing the President to execute the Construction Contract as recommended by staff\nand authorizing the President to make non-substantive changes if necessary.)\nCapital Improvement Authorization (Motion: | move to approve the Chair to Execute\nthe Capital Improvement Authorization as recommended by staff, and authorizing the\nPresident to execute the Construction Contract, upon obtaining satisfactory\ndocumentation as required therein after consultation with legal counsel, as recommended\nby staff and authorizing the President to make non-substantive changes if necessary.)",
